#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Today’s topic is about what teens see online. \n"
"\n"
"Teens see all kinds of things online. Some of it is interesting, some is confusing or upsetting, and some is not even real."
msgstr ""
"Isihloko sanamhlanje simalunga nento abantwana abafikisayo abayibonayo kumakhasi onxibelelwano. \n"
"\n"
"Abantwana abafikisayo babona zonke iintlobo zezinto kumakhasi onxibelelwano. Ezinye zazo zinika umdla, ezinye ziyabhidisa okanye ziyacaphukisa, kwaye ezinye aziyonyani."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Many teens come across sexual content, often without looking for it. They may feel curious, confused or uncomfortable. These feelings are normal. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Many parents feel unsure how to talk about this. That's normal too. What helps most is staying calm and talking together."
msgstr ""
"Abantwana abaninzi abafikisayo baye badibane nemixholo engesondo, rhoqo ngaphandle kokuba kokuyikhangela. Bangaziva benomdla, bebhidekile okanye bengakhululekanga. Ezi mvakalelo ziqhelekile. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Abazali abaninzi baziva bengaqinisekanga ukuba bangathetha njani malunga ngalento. Naleyo iqhelekile nayo. Eyona nto inceda kakhulu kukuhlala uzolile kwaye nithethe kunye."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.media_female_1.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Hear how talking openly helped @data.characters.media_female_1.name and her teen connect"
msgstr "Mamela ukuba ukuthetha ngokuphandle kumncede njani u@data.characters.media_female_1.name ukuba anxulumane nomntwana wakhe ofikisayo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "The other day, my son told me that a sexual video had popped up on his phone. I didn’t know what to say and I wanted to panic, but instead I listened first and we could talk. It was an uncomfortable conversation, but I'm glad we had it. Now he knows he can come to me if something online worries or confuses him."
msgstr "Kusuku oludlulileyo, unyana wam undixelela ukuba kuvele iVidiyo enomxholo wokwabelana ngesondo kwifowuni yakhe. Ndiye ndangazi ukuba mandithini, kwaye bendifuna nokothuka, kodwa endaweni yoko ndiye ndammamela kuqala saze saxoxa kamva. Ibiyincoko engakhululekisiyo, kodwa ndiyavuya sibenayo. Ngoku uyazi ukuba angeza kum xa kukho into kwi-internet emxhalabisayo okanye emdidayo."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let’s see how @data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name talks to her mother about something she saw online."
msgstr "Masibone indlela u @data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name athetha ngayo no mama wakhe ngento ayibone kwi-internet."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.friend_male_1.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Hey, look at this! People are saying it’s @data.characters.friend_male_1.name from our school."
msgstr "Hey, jonge lento! Abantu bathi ngu @data.characters.friend_male_1.name wase sikolweni sethu."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yeah… something doesn’t look right."
msgstr "Yeah… ikhona into engabonakali kakuhle."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "People can fake videos now… make it look like someone did something they didn’t do. They can even put someone’s face on a naked body."
msgstr "Abantu bayakwazi ukwenza ividiyo ezingeyonyani ngoku…benze ngathi umntu wenze into engayenzanga. Bangabeka nobuso balomntu kumzimba oze/umzimba onganxibanga."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yeah. I mean, everyone has seen it already anyway."
msgstr "Ewe. Ndixela uba, wonke umntu sele eyibonile ngoku."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Okay, that makes sense. Thank you, mother."
msgstr "Kulungile, kwaye kuyevakala. Enkosi mama."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let's think about what happened."
msgstr "Masicinge ngalento yenzekileyo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes, staying calm helps your teen feel safe to talk."
msgstr "Ewe, ukuhlala uzolile kwenza umntwana wakho ofikisayo azive ekhuselekile ukuba angathetha nawe."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ask simple questions"
msgstr "Buza imibuzo elula"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Exactly. Questions help your teen think about what they are seeing."
msgstr "Kunjalo kanye. Imibuzo inceda umntwana wakho ofikisayo acinge ngoko akubonayo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Talk about not sharing too quickly"
msgstr "Thetha ngoku nga khawulezi abelane kwa kamsinya"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes, pausing before sharing can prevent harm."
msgstr "Ewe, ukunqumama phambi kokwabelana kungathintela ukonzakala."

#. type=data_list
#. The following strings should not be translated: 
#.      @data.characters.f1_father.name
#.      @data.characters.f1_son_14.name
#.      @data.characters.f1_son_14.name
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_father.name and @data.characters.f1_son_14.name are making a fire for a braai. @data.characters.f1_son_14.name looks at his phone to put on some music."
msgstr "U @data.characters.f1_father.name no @data.characters.f1_son_14.name babasa umlilo wokoja inyama. U @data.characters.f1_son_14.name ujonge ifowuni yakhe uvula umculo."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name, should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_son_14.name, you know how sometimes things just pop up on your phone?"
msgstr "@data.characters.f1_son_14.name, uyazi ukuba ngamanye amaxesha izinto zivele zivumbuke nje kwi fowuni yakho?"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name? should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Why is it important for father to have this conversation with @data.characters.f1_son_14.name?"
msgstr "Kutheni kubalulekile ukuba utata abenencoko no @data.characters.f1_son_14.name?"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_son_14.name may feel confused or unsure"
msgstr "U @data.characters.f1_son_14.name angaziva edidekile or engaqinisekanga"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Correct. What is shown is often not real and can give confusing ideas about relationships."
msgstr "Ngokwenyani. Lento ibonisiweyo idla ngokungabiyo nyani kwaye ingadala ingcinga ezididayo ngobudlelwane."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_son_14.name needs to know he can talk"
msgstr "U @data.characters.f1_son_14.name kufuneka azi ukuba angathetha"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That’s right. When teens feel safe to talk, they are more likely to ask for help."
msgstr "Kunjalo. Xa ulutsha luziva lukhuselekile ukuba luthethe, ludla ngokulucela uncedo."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ignoring it may create problems for @data.characters.f1_son_14.name"
msgstr "Ukungayihoyi kungadala ingxaki ku @data.characters.f1_son_14.name"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Keep phones in shared spaces"
msgstr "Ngcina iifowuni kwiindawo ekwabelwana ngazo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Charge phones outside the bedroom"
msgstr "Tshaja ifoni ngaphandle kwigumbi lokulala"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Talk about what to do if something happens"
msgstr "Thetha malunga nento onokuyenza ukuba kukho eyenzekayo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Yes. Simple, agreed rules can help teens see less of this and feel safer to ask for help.\n"
"\n"
"Father can also explore how to add parental controls and content filters."
msgstr ""
"Ewe. Ngokulula, imithetho ekuvunyelwene ngayo inganceda abantwana abafikisayo bayibone kancinci le nto kwaye bazive bekhuselekile ukucela uncedo.\n"
"\n"
"Utata naye angakwazi ukuphonononga ukuba angayifaka njani ulwawulo lwabazali kunye nee filters zomxholo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Check in regularly"
msgstr "Jonga rhoqo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Yes, checking in regularly can help your teen know that you are there to support.\n"
"\n"
"Father can also explore how to add parental controls and content filters."
msgstr ""
"Ewe, ukujonga rhoqo kungakwazi ukunceda umntwana wakho ofikisayo ukuba ayazi ukhona ukumxhasa.\n"
"\n"
"Utata naye angakwazi ukuphononga ukuba angafaka njani u lwawulo lwabazali kunye ne filters zomxholo."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"It was good to see @data.characters.f1_son_14.name talk openly with his father.\n"
"\n"
"One day your teen may come to you with something they have seen. How you respond teaches your teen whether it is safe to come to you again."
msgstr ""
"Bekulungile ukubona u @data.characters.f1_son_14.name ethetha ngokuphandle kunye notata wakhe.\n"
"\n"
"Ngenye imini umntwana wakho ofikisayo angeza kuwe nento ayibonileyo. Indlela ophendula ngayo ifundisa umntwana wakho ofikisayo wokuba kukhuselekile ukuza kuwe kwakhona."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Stay calm and take a breath"
msgstr "Hlala uzolile kwaye uphefumle"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Before you answer, take a breath."
msgstr "Phambi kokuba uphendule, phefumla."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ask and listen"
msgstr "Buza kwaye mamela"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Try asking simple, open questions such as:\n"
"\n"
"- “Can you tell me what happened?”\n"
"- “How did it make you feel?”\n"
"- “What do you think about what you saw?”\n"
"\n"
"Listen without judging or rushing to solve the problem."
msgstr ""
"Zama ukubuza imibuzo elula, evulekileyo enjengale:\n"
"\n"
"-\"Ungakwazi ukundixelela okwenzekileyo?\"\n"
"-\"Ikwenze waziva njani wena?\"\n"
"-\"Ucinga ntoni malunga nento oyibonileyo?\"\n"
"\n"
"Mamela ngaphandle kokohlulela okanye ukungxamela ukusombulula ingxaki."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Reassure and support your teen"
msgstr "Qinisekisa kwaye uxhase umntwana wakho ofikisayo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"You could say:\n"
"\n"
"- “Thank you for telling me.”\n"
"- “You did not do anything wrong.”\n"
"- “We can work through this together.”\n"
"\n"
"This helps reduce shame and makes it more likely your teen will come to you again."
msgstr ""
"Ungakwazi nokuthi:\n"
"\n"
"-\"Enkosi ngokundixelela.\"\n"
"-\"Awenzanga nanye into engalunganga.\"\n"
"-\"Singakwazi ukusebenzisana kulento kunye.\"\n"
"\n"
"Lento inceda ukwehlisa ihlazo kwaye yenza kuqheleke ukuba umntwana wakho ofikisayo eze kuwe kwakhona."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "End with connection"
msgstr "Gqibezela ngonxibelelwano"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let your teen know they can always come to you if something online worries or confuses them."
msgstr "Vumela umntwana wakho ofikisayo ayazi ukuba angaza kuwe ukuba into ekumakhasi onxibelelwano iyamkhathaza okanye iyambhida."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Here are some simple ways you can support your teen when they see or share things online that are confusing or sensitive."
msgstr "Nazi ezinye iindlela ezilula ongakwazi ukuxhasa umntwawna wakho ofikisayo xana ebona okanye esabelana ngezinto ezimbhidayo okanye ezibucayi."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "PREVENT"
msgstr "THINTELA"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"You cannot protect your teen from everything online, but simple routines and guidance can help.\n"
"\n"
"For example, leave devices, including phones, in shared family spaces."
msgstr ""
"Awukwazi ukukhusela umntwana wakho kwinto yonke yamakhasi onxibelelwano, kodwa inkqubo ezilula kunye nokukhokela kunganceda.\n"
"\n"
"Umzekelo, shiya izixhobo ukuquka iifoni, ukwabelana ngamathuba oosapho."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "THINK BEFORE YOU SHARE"
msgstr "CINGA PHAMBI KOKUBA WABELANE"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "STAY CALM"
msgstr "Hlala uzolile"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "More tips"
msgstr "Ezinye iingcebiso"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "TALK RESPECT"
msgstr "Thetha ngentlonipho"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Stay calm and ask questions"
msgstr "Hlala uzolile kwaye ubuze imibuzo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Say you are not sure and think together"
msgstr "Yitsho ukuba awuqinisekanga kwaye nicinge kunye"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes. Staying calm and discussing together helps your teen think and make safer choices."
msgstr "Ewe. Ukuhlala uzolile kwaye nixoxe kunye kunceda umntwana wakho ofikisayo acinge kwaye enze izigqibo ezikhuselekileyo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Not quite. Angry reactions or avoiding the conversation can stop your teen from sharing. Staying calm helps them feel safe to talk."
msgstr "Akunjalo. Ukuphendula ngomsindo okanye ukutyeshela incoko kungenza umntwana wakho ofikisayo ayeke ukwabelana nawe. Ukuhlala uzolile kunceda ukuba bazive bekhuselekile ukuba bangathetha."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Get angry and blame them"
msgstr "Yiba nomsindo kwaye uthyole bona"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Reassure it’s not their fault"
msgstr "Baqinisekise ukuba akulotyala labo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ignore it"
msgstr "Suyihoya"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That may not work. Strong reactions or ignoring it can make your teen feel ashamed and stop them from sharing."
msgstr "Kusenokungasebenzi. I-reaction ezingamandla okanye ukungahoyi kungenza umntwana wakho ofikisayo azive enentloni kwaye ayeke ukwabelana."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Stay calm and listen"
msgstr "Hlala uzolile kwaye umamele"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes. Staying calm and reassuring your teen helps them feel safe to talk and reduces shame."
msgstr "Ewe. Ukuzola nokumqinisekisa umntwana wakho ofikisayo kumnceda ngokuba azive ekhuselekile ukuthetha nawe kwaye kuphungule intloni."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"**Remember to ask:** \n"
"\n"
"What do you think about it? Do you think it is real? Why do you think it was shared? How can this affect others? \n"
"\n"
"Listen without judging and thank your teen for sharing."
msgstr ""
"**Khumbula ukubuza:** \n"
"\n"
"Ucinga ntoni ngayo? Ucinga ukuba yinyani? Ucinga ukuba kutheni kwabelwane ngayo? Ingabachaphazela njani abanye abantu?\n"
"\n"
"Mamela ngaphandle kokugweba kwaye umbulele umntwana wakho ofikisayo ngokwazi ukwabelana nawe."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Can you talk with your teen about something they have seen online this week?"
msgstr "Ungathetha nomntwana wakho ofikisayo ngento oyibone kwi internet kuleveki?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ewe"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "I think so"
msgstr "Ndicinga njalo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Hayi"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Here is a short video to help you slow down before you go"
msgstr "Nali ushicilelo olufutshane elizokunceda wehlise ngaphambi kokuba uhambe"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"When everything feels like it is falling apart And you can't help but raise your voice When all the frustrations are beginning to start Remember that you have a choice\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more\n"
"\n"
"You can take pause, you can count to 10 Play a game or do something fun You can phone a friend, someone to confide in Remember you're not the only one\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more Because I really couldn't love you more"
msgstr ""
"Xa yonke into ivakala ingathi iyamoshakala Kwaye awukwazi ukuzinceda uvele unyuse ilizwi Xa zonke iinzingo ziqala Khumbula ukuba ungenza ngakumbi\n"
"\n"
"Makhe sime kancinci Tsala umoya kancinci Khumbula konke esino kubulela ngako Makhe sehlise kancinci Tsala umoya kancinci Kuba andinakuthanda ngakumbi\n"
"\n"
"Yima, ungabala uyokutsho ku 10 Dlala umdlalo okanye wenze into emnandi Ungafowunela umhlobo, umntu onokumchazela ingxaki Khumbula ayinguwe wedwa\n"
"\n"
"Makhe sime kancinci Tsala umoya kancinci Khumbula konke esino kubulela ngako Makhe sime Tsala umoya kancinci Kuba bendingenokuthanda ngakumbi \n"
"\n"
"Makhe sime kancinci Tsalaa umoya Khumbula konke esino kubulela ngako Makhe sime Tsalaa umoya kancinci Kuba bendingenokuthanda ngakumbi Kuba bendingenokuthanda ngakumbi"

